            "description_html": "<b>Schlage FE285CEN, Century Handleset Grip Bottom Only</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a custom handleset. It comes packaged with the Schlage Custom Century Handleset Grip and your choice of interior trim knob or lever. No deadbolt. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Bottom OnlyCentury Handleset with No Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Center to Center Grip Range: adjustable 8-1/2\" to 9-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Grip Escutcheon Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Height: 11-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: will fit 1-5/8\" up to 1-3/4\" packaged with extra screws to accommodate 2\" doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Custom item, NOT Returnable</b>\r\n</p>",
